,"tokens":["學生","你","是","我"],"id":"student-3"}],"unitId":"unit-1","review":false},{"id":"question","title":"Ask a question","subtitle":"One small word changes the sentence","chars":["嗎"],"minutes":"4–6 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"嗎","id":"嗎-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"嗎","id":"嗎-1"},{"type":"parts","char":"嗎","prompt":"What does 馬 contribute to 嗎?","options":["A clue to the sound ma","The meaning horse","A plural ending"],"answer":"A clue to the sound ma","explanation":"馬 (mǎ) is a sound component in 嗎 (ma). 嗎 is a question particle; its meaning is not horse.","id":"嗎-2"},{"type":"build","char":"嗎","id":"嗎-3"},{"type":"complete","char":"嗎","id":"嗎-4"},{"type":"select","char":"嗎","prompt":"Which character means “yes/no question particle”?","answer":"嗎","options":["嗎","你","好","我"],"explanation":"嗎 (ma) means yes/no question particle.","id":"嗎-5"},{"type":"memory","char":"嗎","id":"嗎-6"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"question","id":"question-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"question","tokens":["嗎","我","學生","是","你"],"id":"question-1"},{"type":"listen","char":"嗎","options":["我","嗎","生","好"],"answer":"嗎","explanation":"嗎 is ma, the light-toned particle for yes/no questions.","id":"question-2"}],"unitId":"unit-1","review":false},{"id":"review","title":"Unit 1 review","subtitle":"Bring all seven characters together","chars":["你","好","我","是","學","生","嗎"],"minutes":"6–8 min","steps":[{"type":"match","chars":["你","好","我","是"],"id":"review-0"},{"type":"match","chars":["學","生","嗎"],"id":"review-1"},{"type":"build","char":"好","id":"review-2"},{"type":"build","char":"嗎","id":"review-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"你","id":"review-4"},{"type":"memory","char":"我","id":"review-5"},{"type":"memory","char":"學","id":"review-6"},{"type":"memory","char":"嗎","id":"review-7"},{"type":"order","phrase":"identity","tokens":["你","學生","我","嗎","是"],"id":"review-8"},{"type":"order","phrase":"question","tokens":["學生","嗎","好","你","是"],"id":"review-9"},{"type":"listen","char":"生","options":["是","我","學","生"],"answer":"生","explanation":"生 is shēng, as in 學生 (student).","id":"review-10"}],"unitId":"unit-1","review":true},{"id":"u2-people","title":"Talk about other people","subtitle":"He and she, with a familiar pattern","chars":["他","她"],"minutes":"5–7 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"他","id":"u2-char-他-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"他","id":"u2-char-他-1"},{"type":"build","char":"他","id":"u2-char-他-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"他","id":"u2-char-他-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"他","id":"u2-char-他-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"她","id":"u2-char-她-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"她","id":"u2-char-她-1"},{"type":"build","char":"她","id":"u2-char-她-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"她","id":"u2-char-她-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"她","id":"u2-char-她-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-pronouns","id":"u2-people-0"},{"type":"match","chars":["他","她","你","我"],"id":"u2-people-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-he","tokens":["是","她","學生","他"],"id":"u2-people-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-she","tokens":["學生","她","他","是"],"id":"u2-people-3"}],"unitId":"unit-2","review":false},{"id":"u2-together","title":"We are students too","subtitle":"Make a group. Add also.","chars":["們","也"],"minutes":"6–8 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"們","id":"u2-char-們-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"們","id":"u2-char-們-1"},{"type":"build","char":"們","id":"u2-char-們-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"們","id":"u2-char-們-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"們","id":"u2-char-們-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-plurals","id":"u2-plural-first-0"},{"type":"intro","char":"也","id":"u2-char-也-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"也","id":"u2-char-也-1"},{"type":"select","char":"也","prompt":"Which character means “also; too”?","answer":"也","options":["也","我","是","好"],"explanation":"也 (yě) means also; too.","id":"u2-char-也-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"也","id":"u2-char-也-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"也","id":"u2-char-也-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-also","id":"u2-together-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-we","tokens":["是","我們","學生","你們"],"id":"u2-together-1"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Which word addresses more than one person: “you” (plural)?","options":["你們","我們","他們"],"answer":"你們","explanation":"你們 (nǐmen) means you when you are speaking to a group.","grammarIds":["u2-plurals"],"id":"u2-together-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-they-too","tokens":["也","學生","是","他們","我們"],"id":"u2-together-3"}],"unitId":"unit-2","review":false},{"id":"u2-not","title":"Say “not”","subtitle":"A small change before the verb","chars":["不"],"minutes":"4–6 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"不","id":"u2-char-不-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"不","id":"u2-char-不-1"},{"type":"select","char":"不","prompt":"Which character means “not”?","answer":"不","options":["不","我","是","好"],"explanation":"不 (bù) means not.","id":"u2-char-不-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"不","id":"u2-char-不-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"不","id":"u2-char-不-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-not","id":"u2-not-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u2-not-student","id":"u2-not-1"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Someone asks 你是學生嗎？ You are not a student. Which short answer fits?","options":["不是","是","也是"],"answer":"不是","explanation":"不是 (bú shì) means no, I am not. Repeat 是 in its negative form.","grammarIds":["u2-not"],"id":"u2-not-2"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Which order means “is not either”?","options":["也不是","不也是","是也不"],"answer":"也不是","explanation":"For this meaning, put 也 before 不, then 是: 也不是.","grammarIds":["u2-not","u2-also"],"id":"u2-not-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-neither","tokens":["是","也","學生","她","不"],"id":"u2-not-4"}],"unitId":"unit-2","review":false},{"id":"u2-mine","title":"My student, your student","subtitle":"Use 的 to show a connection","chars":["的"],"minutes":"4–6 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"的","id":"u2-char-的-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"的","id":"u2-char-的-1"},{"type":"build","char":"的","id":"u2-char-的-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"的","id":"u2-char-的-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"的","id":"u2-char-的-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-possession","id":"u2-mine-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u2-my-student","id":"u2-mine-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-your-student","tokens":["學生","的","我","你"],"id":"u2-mine-2"},{"type":"select","prompt":"What does 他的學生 mean?","options":["his student","he is a student","they are students"],"answer":"his student","explanation":"他 + 的 + 學生 = his student. 的 links him to the noun; it is not the verb 是.","grammarIds":["u2-possession"],"id":"u2-mine-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-she-my-student","tokens":["我","學生","她","的","是"],"id":"u2-mine-4"}],"unitId":"unit-2","review":false},{"id":"u2-count","title":"One person","subtitle":"Meet your first measure word","chars":["一","個","人"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"一","id":"u2-char-一-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"一","id":"u2-char-一-1"},{"type":"select","char":"一","prompt":"Which character means “one”?","answer":"一","options":["一","我","是","好"],"explanation":"一 (yī) means one.","id":"u2-char-一-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"一","id":"u2-char-一-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"一","id":"u2-char-一-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"個","id":"u2-char-個-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"個","id":"u2-char-個-1"},{"type":"build","char":"個","id":"u2-char-個-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"個","id":"u2-char-個-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"個","id":"u2-char-個-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"人","id":"u2-char-人-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"人","id":"u2-char-人-1"},{"type":"select","char":"人","prompt":"Which character means “person; people”?","answer":"人","options":["人","我","是","好"],"explanation":"人 (rén) means person; people.","id":"u2-char-人-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"人","id":"u2-char-人-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"人","id":"u2-char-人-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-counting","id":"u2-count-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u2-one-person","id":"u2-count-1"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Fill the measure-word slot: 一 __ 學生","options":["個","的","們"],"answer":"個","explanation":"一個學生 = one student. 個 goes between the number and the person you are counting.","grammarIds":["u2-counting"],"id":"u2-count-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-one-person","tokens":["人","個","一","的"],"id":"u2-count-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-one-student","tokens":["個","學生","一","們"],"id":"u2-count-4"},{"type":"listen","char":"一","options":["一","人","個","也"],"answer":"一","explanation":"一 is yī on its own: one. In 一個, its tone changes to yí.","grammarIds":["u2-counting"],"id":"u2-count-5"}],"unitId":"unit-2","review":false},{"id":"u2-have","title":"Have and don’t have","subtitle":"有, 沒有, and a useful question","chars":["有","沒"],"minutes":"6–8 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"有","id":"u2-char-有-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"有","id":"u2-char-有-1"},{"type":"build","char":"有","id":"u2-char-有-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"有","id":"u2-char-有-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"有","id":"u2-char-有-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-have","id":"u2-have-first-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-has-student","tokens":["個","她","一","學生","有","是"],"id":"u2-have-first-1"},{"type":"intro","char":"沒","id":"u2-char-沒-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"沒","id":"u2-char-沒-1"},{"type":"build","char":"沒","id":"u2-char-沒-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"沒","id":"u2-char-沒-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"沒","id":"u2-char-沒-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-no-have","id":"u2-have-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-no-students","tokens":["沒有","學生","我","不"],"id":"u2-have-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u2-nobody","tokens":["人","是","沒有"],"id":"u2-have-2"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u2-have-question","id":"u2-have-3"},{"type":"select","prompt":"你有學生嗎？ You do not have any students. Choose the short answer.","options":["沒有","不是","有"],"answer":"沒有","explanation":"This question uses 有 (have). Its negative answer is 沒有 (do not have). 不是 answers an identity question with 是.","grammarIds":["u2-have-question","u2-no-have"],"id":"u2-have-4"}],"unitId":"unit-2","review":false},{"id":"u2-review","title":"Unit 2 review","subtitle":"People, connections, and everyday sentences","chars":["他","她","們","也","不"