 人","options":["個","的","們"],"answer":"個","explanation":"這個人 = this person. The full pointing pattern is 這 + measure word + noun.","grammarIds":["u3-point"],"id":"u3-point-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-this-person","tokens":["人","是","這","學生","個","那"],"id":"u3-point-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-that-person","tokens":["的","那","學生","我","人","個","是"],"id":"u3-point-4"}],"unitId":"unit-3","review":false},{"id":"u3-what","title":"What is this?","subtitle":"Ask about something. Meet your first book.","chars":["什","麼","書"],"minutes":"8–10 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"什","id":"u3-char-什-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"什","id":"u3-char-什-1"},{"type":"build","char":"什","id":"u3-char-什-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"什","id":"u3-char-什-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"什","id":"u3-char-什-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"麼","id":"u3-char-麼-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"麼","id":"u3-char-麼-1"},{"type":"build","char":"麼","id":"u3-char-麼-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"麼","id":"u3-char-麼-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"麼","id":"u3-char-麼-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"書","id":"u3-char-書-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"書","id":"u3-char-書-1"},{"type":"build","char":"書","id":"u3-char-書-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"書","id":"u3-char-書-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"書","id":"u3-char-書-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-what","id":"u3-what-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u3-what-this","id":"u3-what-1"},{"type":"select","prompt":"You want to know what something is, not ask a yes/no question. Choose the question.","options":["這是什麼？","這是書嗎？","這是書。"],"answer":"這是什麼？","explanation":"什麼 asks for the missing information. 這是書嗎？ only asks whether it is a book. Do not add 嗎 to the 什麼 question.","grammarIds":["u3-what"],"id":"u3-what-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-what-that","tokens":["什麼","嗎","那","是","這"],"id":"u3-what-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-that-my-book","tokens":["我","書","是","那","的","你"],"id":"u3-what-4"},{"type":"listen","char":"書","options":["書","是","這","那"],"answer":"書","explanation":"書 is shū: book or books. Listen for its first tone.","id":"u3-what-5"}],"unitId":"unit-3","review":false},{"id":"u3-books","title":"One book, two books","subtitle":"A new measure word, a familiar pattern","chars":["本","兩"],"minutes":"6–8 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"本","id":"u3-char-本-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"本","id":"u3-char-本-1"},{"type":"select","char":"本","prompt":"Which character means “measure word for books”?","answer":"本","options":["本","我","是","好"],"explanation":"本 (běn) means measure word for books.","id":"u3-char-本-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"本","id":"u3-char-本-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"本","id":"u3-char-本-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-books","id":"u3-books-first-0"},{"type":"intro","char":"兩","id":"u3-char-兩-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"兩","id":"u3-char-兩-1"},{"type":"select","char":"兩","prompt":"Which character means “two (when counting things)”?","answer":"兩","options":["兩","我","是","好"],"explanation":"兩 (liǎng) means two (when counting things).","id":"u3-char-兩-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"兩","id":"u3-char-兩-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"兩","id":"u3-char-兩-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-two","id":"u3-books-0"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Fill the measure-word slot in “two books”: 兩 __ 書","options":["本","個","的"],"answer":"本","explanation":"Books use 本: 兩本書. Keep 個 for people and students in this unit.","grammarIds":["u3-books","u3-two"],"id":"u3-books-1"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Which phrase means “two people”?","options":["兩個人","兩本人","一個人"],"answer":"兩個人","explanation":"兩 means two before a measure word. People take 個: 兩個人.","grammarIds":["u3-two","u2-counting"],"id":"u3-books-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-two-books","tokens":["本","有","我","書","兩","個"],"id":"u3-books-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-that-book","tokens":["書","那","本","個","這"],"id":"u3-books-4"}],"unitId":"unit-3","review":false},{"id":"u3-size","title":"Big and small","subtitle":"Describe a book without 是","chars":["很","大","小"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"很","id":"u3-char-很-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"很","id":"u3-char-很-1"},{"type":"build","char":"很","id":"u3-char-很-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"很","id":"u3-char-很-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"很","id":"u3-char-很-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"大","id":"u3-char-大-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"大","id":"u3-char-大-1"},{"type":"select","char":"大","prompt":"Which character means “big; large”?","answer":"大","options":["大","我","是","好"],"explanation":"大 (dà) means big; large.","id":"u3-char-大-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"大","id":"u3-char-大-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"大","id":"u3-char-大-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"小","id":"u3-char-小-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"小","id":"u3-char-小-1"},{"type":"select","char":"小","prompt":"Which character means “small; little”?","answer":"小","options":["小","我","是","好"],"explanation":"小 (xiǎo) means small; little.","id":"u3-char-小-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"小","id":"u3-char-小-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"小","id":"u3-char-小-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-adjectives","id":"u3-size-positive-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-big-book","tokens":["大","這","書","本","很","是"],"id":"u3-size-positive-1"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-not-size","id":"u3-size-0"},{"type":"select","prompt":"What does 這本書不大 tell you?","options":["This book is not big.","This book must be small.","This is not a book."],"answer":"This book is not big.","explanation":"不大 denies big. It does not necessarily mean small, and it does not deny that the object is a book.","grammarIds":["u3-not-size"],"id":"u3-size-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-small-book","tokens":["書","小","那","本","很","大"],"id":"u3-size-2"},{"type":"listen","char":"大","options":["小","大","本","很"],"answer":"大","explanation":"大 is dà, big, with a falling fourth tone. 小 (xiǎo) means small.","id":"u3-size-3"}],"unitId":"unit-3","review":false},{"id":"u3-here","title":"Here and there","subtitle":"Say where someone or something is","chars":["在","裡"],"minutes":"6–8 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"在","id":"u3-char-在-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"在","id":"u3-char-在-1"},{"type":"build","char":"在","id":"u3-char-在-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"在","id":"u3-char-在-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"在","id":"u3-char-在-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"裡","id":"u3-char-裡-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"裡","id":"u3-char-裡-1"},{"type":"build","char":"裡","id":"u3-char-裡-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"裡","id":"u3-char-裡-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"裡","id":"u3-char-裡-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-location","id":"u3-here-place-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u3-im-here","id":"u3-here-place-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-book-there","tokens":["在","書","我","那裡","的","有"],"id":"u3-here-place-2"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-location-question","id":"u3-here-question-0"},{"type":"select","prompt":"你的書在那裡嗎？ Your book is not there. Choose the short answer.","options":["不在","沒有","不是"],"answer":"不在","explanation":"This is a 在 location question, so answer 不在 (no, it is not there). 沒有 answers a 有 question; 不是 answers a 是 question.","grammarIds":["u3-location-question","u2-have-question","u2-not"],"id":"u3-here-question-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-is-book-there","tokens":["那裡","嗎","的","你","在","書"],"id":"u3-here-question-2"}],"unitId":"unit-3","review":false},{"id":"u3-all","title":"We are all here","subtitle":"Bring the whole group together","chars":["都"],"minutes":"4–6 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"都","id":"u3-char-都-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"都","id":"u3-char-都-1"},{"type":"build","char":"都","id":"u3-char-都-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"都","id":"u3-char-都-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"都","id":"u3-char-都-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u3-all","id":"u3-all-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u3-all-here","id":"u3-all-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-all-students","tokens":["學生","都","他們","是","也"],"id":"u3-all-2"},{"type":"select","prompt":"In 我們都在這裡, who does 都 include?","options":["Everyone in our group.","Only me.","Everyone everywhere."],"answer":"Everyone in our group.","explanation":"都 refers to the group before it: 我們. The sentence says all of us are here, not everyone in the world.","grammarIds":["u3-all"],"id":"u3-all-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-both-there","tokens":["都","那裡","個","學生","兩","在"],"id":"u3-all-4"}],"unitId":"unit-3","review":false},{"id":"u3-review","title":"Unit 3 review","subtitle":"Things, descriptions, and places","chars":["這","那","什","麼","書","本","兩","很","大","小","在","裡","都"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"match","chars":["這","那","大","小"],"id":"u3-review-0"},{"type":"match","chars":["書","本","兩","都"],"id":"u3-review-1"},{"type":"build","char":"裡","id":"u3-review-2"},{"type":"build","char":"麼","id":"u3-review-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"這","id":"u3-review-4"},{"type":"memory","char":"書","id":"u3-review-5"},{"type":"memory","char":"兩","id":"u3-review-6"},{"type":"memory","char":"在","id":"u3-review-7"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-what-this","tokens":["是","什麼","這","嗎","那"],"id":"u3-review-8"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Choose the measure words for “one book” and “one person”, in that order.","options":["本 · 個","個 · 本","本 · 本"],"answer":"本 · 個","explanation":"一本書 uses 本 for books. 一個人 uses 個 for people. Choose the measure word to match the noun.","grammarIds":["u3-books","u2-counting"],"id":"u3-review-9"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-not-big","tokens":["本","不","書","大","這","很"],"id":"u3-review-10"},{"type":"listen","char":"都","options":["在","都","本","書"],"answer":"都","explanation":"都 is dōu in this unit: all, or both for a group of two.","id":"u3-review-11"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-two-books","tokens":["有","書","兩","本","我","個"],"id":"u3-review-12"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u3-all-here","tokens":["這裡","我們","在","都","是"],"id":"u3-review-13"}],"unitId":"unit-3","review":true},{"id":"u4-go","title":"Come and go","subtitle":"Movement, destinations, and where","chars":["去","來","哪"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"去","id":"u4-char-去-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"去","id":"u4-char-去-1"},{"type":"build","char":"去","id":"u4-char-去-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"去","id":"u4-char-去-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"去","id":"u4-char-去-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"來","id":"u4-char-來-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"來","id":"u4-char-來-1"},{"type":"select","char":"來","prompt":"Which character means “come”?","answer":"來","options":["來","我","是","好"],"explanation":"來 (lái) means come.","id":"u4-char-來-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"來","id":"u4-char-來-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"來","id":"u4-char-來-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-movement","id":"u4-go-first-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-go-there","tokens":["那裡","我","去","在"],"id":"u4-go-first-1"},{"type":"intro","char":"哪","id":"u4-char-哪-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"哪","id":"u4-char-哪-1"},{"type":"build","char":"哪","id":"u4-char-哪-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"哪","id":"u4-char-哪-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"哪","id":"u4-char-哪-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-where","id":"u4-go-0"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Which phrase asks “where”, rather than pointing to “there”?","options":["哪裡","那裡","這裡"],"answer":"哪裡","explanation":"哪裡 (nǎlǐ) asks where. 那裡 (nàlǐ) points to there, and 這裡 means here.","grammarIds":["u4-where"],"id":"u4-go-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-where-going","tokens":["哪裡","嗎","你","去","那裡"],"id":"u4-go-2"},{"type":"listen","char":"來","options":["來","去","哪","在"],"answer":"來","explanation":"來 is lái: come, with a rising second tone.","id":"u4-go-3"}],"unitId":"unit-4","review":false},{"id":"u4-read","title":"Read a book","subtitle":"Actions, objects, and a word for and","chars":["看","和"],"minutes":"6–8 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"看","id":"u4-char-看-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"看","id":"u4-char-看-1"},{"type":"build","char":"看","id":"u4-char-看-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"看","id":"u4-char-看-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"看","id":"u4-char-看-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-actions","id":"u4-read-first-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-read-book","tokens":["書","這","看","我","本","是"],"id":"u4-read-first-1"},{"type":"intro","char":"和","id":"u4-char-和-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"和","id":"u4-char-和-1"},{"type":"build","char":"和","id":"u4-char-和-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"和","id":"u4-char-和-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"和","id":"u4-char-和-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-and","id":"u4-read-0"},{"type":"select","prompt":"What does 和 join in 他和她都看書？","options":["He and she: the two people.","Two complete sentences.","Read and books: two actions."],"answer":"He and she: the two people.","explanation":"和 joins 他 and 她 into one subject. 都 follows that whole group, before 看書.","grammarIds":["u4-and","u4-actions","u3-all"],"id":"u4-read-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-both-read","tokens":["都","她","書","他","看","和"],"id":"u4-read-2"},{"type":"listen","char":"看","options":["看","來","去","書"],"answer":"看","explanation":"看 is kàn here. With 書, it means read: 看書.","id":"u4-read-3"}],"unitId":"unit-4","review":false},{"id":"u4-language","title":"Chinese and English","subtitle":"Use a familiar character as a new word","chars":["中","文","英"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"中","id":"u4-char-中-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"中","id":"u4-char-中-1"},{"type":"select","char":"中","prompt":"Which character means “middle; central”?","answer":"中","options":["中","我","是","好"],"explanation":"中 (zhōng) means middle; central.","id":"u4-char-中-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"中","id":"u4-char-中-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"中","id":"u4-char-中-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"文","id":"u4-char-文-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"文","id":"u4-char-文-1"},{"type":"select","char":"文","prompt":"Which character means “writing; language in language names”?","answer":"文","options":["文","我","是","好"],"explanation":"文 (wén) means writing; language in language names.","id":"u4-char-文-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"文","id":"u4-char-文-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"文","id":"u4-char-文-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"英","id":"u4-char-英-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"英","id":"u4-char-英-1"},{"type":"build","char":"英","id":"u4-char-英-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"英","id":"u4-char-英-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"英","id":"u4-char-英-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-languages","id":"u4-language-0"},{"type":"memory","char":"學","id":"u4-language-1"},{"type":"select","prompt":"In 我學中文, what does 學 do?","options":["It is the verb: learn or study.","It means student on its own.","It counts languages."],"answer":"It is the verb: learn or study.","explanation":"學 is now the independent verb learn or study. 學生, with both characters, is the noun student.","grammarIds":["u4-languages"],"id":"u4-language-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-study-chinese","tokens":["中文","我","是","學","英文"],"id":"u4-language-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-study-both","tokens":["和","學","英文","她","中文"],"id":"u4-language-4"},{"type":"listen","char":"文","options":["文","中","英","和"],"answer":"文","explanation":"文 is wén. It is the shared ending in 中文 and 英文.","id":"u4-language-5"}],"unitId":"unit-4","review":false},{"id":"u4-speak","title":"Speak and listen","subtitle":"Two actions for learning a language","chars":["說","聽"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"說","id":"u4-char-說-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"說","id":"u4-char-說-1"},{"type":"build","char":"說","id":"u4-char-說-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"說","id":"u4-char-說-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"說","id":"u4-char-說-4"},{"type":"intro","char":"聽","id":"u4-char-聽-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"聽","id":"u4-char-聽-1"},{"type":"build","char":"聽","id":"u4-char-聽-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"聽","id":"u4-char-聽-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"聽","id":"u4-char-聽-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-speech","id":"u4-speak-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u4-speak-english","id":"u4-speak-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-listen-chinese","tokens":["我","中文","聽","說","是"],"id":"u4-speak-2"},{"type":"select","prompt":"In a listening exercise, you play Chinese audio. Which phrase names listening to it?","options":["聽中文","說中文","學英文"],"answer":"聽中文","explanation":"聽中文 means listen to Chinese. 說中文 means speak Chinese. Listening does not by itself guarantee understanding.","grammarIds":["u4-speech"],"id":"u4-speak-3"},{"type":"listen","char":"說","options":["說","聽","看","學"],"answer":"說","explanation":"說 is shuō: speak or say, with a level first tone.","id":"u4-speak-4"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-all-speak","tokens":["中文","他們","都","說","也"],"id":"u4-speak-5"}],"unitId":"unit-4","review":false},{"id":"u4-want","title":"What would you like to do?","subtitle":"Wishes, intentions, and things you want","chars":["想","要"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"想","id":"u4-char-想-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"想","id":"u4-char-想-1"},{"type":"build","char":"想","id":"u4-char-想-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"想","id":"u4-char-想-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"想","id":"u4-char-想-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-wish","id":"u4-want-first-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u4-want-learn","id":"u4-want-first-1"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-want-read","tokens":["我","書","想","看","是"],"id":"u4-want-first-2"},{"type":"intro","char":"要","id":"u4-char-要-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"要","id":"u4-char-要-1"},{"type":"build","char":"要","id":"u4-char-要-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"要","id":"u4-char-要-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"要","id":"u4-char-要-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-intention","id":"u4-want-0"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-want-book","tokens":["這","要","書","我","本","想"],"id":"u4-want-1"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-negative-wish","id":"u4-want-2"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Which sentence says you do not WANT to go?","options":["我不想去。","我想去。","我不去。"],"answer":"我不想去。","explanation":"不想 denies wanting. 我不去 says I do not go or I am not going, but does not explicitly say what I want.","grammarIds":["u4-negative-wish","u4-wish","u4-actions"],"id":"u4-want-3"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-want-go-where","tokens":["去","哪裡","你","想","嗎"],"id":"u4-want-4"},{"type":"listen","char":"想","options":["想","要","看","來"],"answer":"想","explanation":"想 is xiǎng: want to before an action, or think in other contexts.","id":"u4-want-5"}],"unitId":"unit-4","review":false},{"id":"u4-can","title":"I can speak English","subtitle":"A learned skill, and an honest answer","chars":["會"],"minutes":"4–6 min","steps":[{"type":"intro","char":"會","id":"u4-char-會-0"},{"type":"trace","char":"會","id":"u4-char-會-1"},{"type":"build","char":"會","id":"u4-char-會-2"},{"type":"complete","char":"會","id":"u4-char-會-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"會","id":"u4-char-會-4"},{"type":"grammar","grammar":"u4-ability","id":"u4-can-0"},{"type":"phrase","phrase":"u4-cant-chinese","id":"u4-can-1"},{"type":"select","prompt":"你會說英文嗎？ You know how to speak English. Choose the short answer.","options":["會","有","是"],"answer":"會","explanation":"This question asks about the skill with 會. Repeat 會 for yes, or 不會 for no.","grammarIds":["u4-ability"],"id":"u4-can-2"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-can-english","tokens":["英文","說","會","我","想"],"id":"u4-can-3"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Which phrase specifically means “do not know HOW to speak Chinese”?","options":["不會說中文","不想說中文","不說中文"],"answer":"不會說中文","explanation":"不會說 is about lacking the learned skill. 不想說 is not wanting to speak; 不說 simply negates speaking.","grammarIds":["u4-ability","u4-negative-wish","u4-actions"],"id":"u4-can-4"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-can-question","tokens":["會","嗎","英文","你","說"],"id":"u4-can-5"},{"type":"listen","char":"會","options":["和","會","要","想"],"answer":"會","explanation":"會 is huì. Here it expresses knowing how to do a learned skill.","id":"u4-can-6"}],"unitId":"unit-4","review":false},{"id":"u4-review","title":"Unit 4 review","subtitle":"Where you go, what you do, what you want","chars":["去","來","哪","看","和","中","文","英","說","聽","想","要","會"],"minutes":"7–9 min","steps":[{"type":"match","chars":["去","來","看","聽"],"id":"u4-review-0"},{"type":"match","chars":["和","學","想","會"],"id":"u4-review-1"},{"type":"build","char":"說","id":"u4-review-2"},{"type":"build","char":"英","id":"u4-review-3"},{"type":"memory","char":"去","id":"u4-review-4"},{"type":"memory","char":"看","id":"u4-review-5"},{"type":"memory","char":"想","id":"u4-review-6"},{"type":"memory","char":"會","id":"u4-review-7"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-where-book","tokens":["書","哪裡","我","的","在","嗎"],"id":"u4-review-8"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-study-both","tokens":["中文","學","她","英文","和"],"id":"u4-review-9"},{"type":"select","prompt":"Choose the measure word in “I want this book”: 我要這 __ 書","options":["本","個","和"],"answer":"本","explanation":"A new action does not change the book phrase: 這本書 still uses 本, just as it did in Unit 3.","grammarIds":["u4-intention","u3-books"],"id":"u4-review-10"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-dont-want-go","tokens":["去","我","想","不","是"],"id":"u4-review-11"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-cant-chinese","tokens":["我","說","不","會","中文","想"],"id":"u4-review-12"},{"type":"order","phrase":"u4-want-learn","tokens":["學","我","中文","想","會"],"id":"u4-review-13"}],"unitId":"unit-4","review":true}]